<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (I texted a friend to hang out. It's been a day, and I haven't heard back. I notice I keep checking my phone and wondering if I did something to upset her the last time we hung out. I really want to send another text, but I don't. Instead, I eat a bag of chips and decide not to reach out to her again for a while. Looking back, I notice I often assume silence means I've done something wrong and pull away before I have the chance to find out.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
