154 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 100 0 R
/E (I shared something I've been struggling with with a friend. Afterwards, I felt flooded and overwhelmed. My mind kept wondering if I'd shared too much and what they must think of me. When I got home, I went straight to bed even though it was the afternoon. For the next little while, I found myself avoiding that friend because I felt embarrassed. Looking back, I notice this tends to happen after I've been vulnerable.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [12]
>>
